{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-9618","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9263","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9264","text":" — κ-Aware Deliberation for the [&] Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-9619","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9265","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9266","text":" is the capability page for the "},{"id":"spn-9267","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9268","text":" subtype in the [&] Protocol."}]},{"id":"blk-9620","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9269","text":"It represents a reasoning surface optimized for "},{"id":"spn-9270","marks":["bold"],"text":"cyclic knowledge regions"},{"id":"spn-9271","text":" where simple one-shot evaluation is often insufficient."}]},{"id":"blk-9621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9272","text":"In short:"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9273","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9274","text":" is the protocol capability for agents that must reason through feedback loops using topology-aware decomposition and reconciliation."}]}],"id":"blk-9622","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-9624","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9275","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9625","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9276","text":"1. Definition"}]},{"id":"blk-9626","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9277","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9278","text":" is a subtype of "},{"id":"spn-9279","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-9280","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-9627","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9281","text":"It describes a focused reasoning capability that consumes graph-structural context (for example SCCs, κ values, and fault lines) and produces:"}]},{"id":"blk-9628","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9630","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9282","text":"reconciled conclusions"}]}],"id":"blk-9629","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9632","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9283","text":"confidence-scored outputs"}]}],"id":"blk-9631","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9634","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9284","text":"optional crystallized knowledge suitable for write-back into memory"}]}],"id":"blk-9633","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9635","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9285","text":"Unlike generic reasoning steps, "},{"id":"spn-9286","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9287","text":" is explicitly designed to operate on "},{"id":"spn-9288","marks":["bold"],"text":"non-acyclic"},{"id":"spn-9289","text":" knowledge structures."}]},{"id":"blk-9636","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9290","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9637","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9291","text":"2. Why this capability exists"}]},{"id":"blk-9638","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9292","text":"Many decision problems are not DAG-shaped. They contain circular dependencies such as:"}]},{"id":"blk-9639","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9641","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9293","text":"demand ↔ pricing feedback"}]}],"id":"blk-9640","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9643","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9294","text":"quality ↔ retention feedback"}]}],"id":"blk-9642","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9645","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9295","text":"risk ↔ intervention feedback"}]}],"id":"blk-9644","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9646","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9296","text":"In these cases, a direct “retrieve then decide” step can underperform because the model must juggle mutually dependent assumptions."}]},{"id":"blk-9647","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9297","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9298","text":" exists to make this structure explicit and routable:"}]},{"id":"blk-9648","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9299","text":"1. detect cyclic structure from memory topology 2. decompose along weak links (fault lines) 3. run focused passes on scoped partitions 4. reconcile intermediate conclusions"}]},{"id":"blk-9649","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9300","text":"This improves controllability, auditability, and consistency in high-friction reasoning regions."}]},{"id":"blk-9650","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9301","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9651","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9302","text":"3. Where it fits in the protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-9652","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9303","text":"The [&] Protocol organizes cognition, embodiment, and governance into six primitive families:"}]},{"id":"blk-9653","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9655","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9304","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-9305","text":" — what the agent knows"}]}],"id":"blk-9654","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9657","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9306","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-9307","text":" — how the agent decides"}]}],"id":"blk-9656","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9659","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9308","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-9309","text":" — when things happen"}]}],"id":"blk-9658","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9661","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9310","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-9311","text":" — where things are"}]}],"id":"blk-9660","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9663","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9312","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-9313","text":" — how the agent is instantiated in an environment (perception, action, affordance)"}]}],"id":"blk-9662","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9665","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9314","marks":["code"],"text":"&govern"},{"id":"spn-9315","text":" — who is acting, under what rules, at what cost"}]}],"id":"blk-9664","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9666","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9316","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9317","text":" sits under "},{"id":"spn-9318","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-9319","text":" and composes most naturally with:"}]},{"id":"blk-9667","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9320","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-9321","text":" (topology and retrieval grounding)"}]}],"id":"blk-9668","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9671","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9322","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.attend"},{"id":"spn-9323","text":" (attention routing into deliberate work)"}]}],"id":"blk-9670","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9673","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9324","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.*"},{"id":"spn-9325","text":" write-back flows for crystallized conclusions"}]}],"id":"blk-9672","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9674","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9326","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9675","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9327","text":"4. Capability contract (representative)"}]},{"id":"blk-9676","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/capability-contract.schema.json\",\n  \"capability\": \"&reason.deliberate\",\n  \"provider\": \"graphonomous\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"description\": \"κ-driven deliberation contract for topology-aware focused reasoning over cyclic knowledge regions.\",\n  \"operations\": {\n    \"deliberate\": {\n      \"in\": \"topology_result\",\n      \"out\": \"deliberation_result\"\n    },\n    \"decompose\": {\n      \"in\": \"topology_result\",\n      \"out\": \"partitions\"\n    },\n    \"reconcile\": {\n      \"in\": \"intermediate_conclusions\",\n      \"out\": \"deliberation_result\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"accepts_from\": [\"&memory.graph\", \"&memory.*\", \"topology_result\", \"context\"],\n  \"feeds_into\": [\"&memory.graph\", \"&reason.*\", \"deliberation_result\", \"output\"],\n  \"a2a_skills\": [\"topology-aware-deliberation\", \"fault-line-reconciliation\"]\n}"},{"id":"blk-9677","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9328","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9678","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9329","text":"5. Operations"}]},{"id":"blk-9679","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9330","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberate"}]},{"id":"blk-9680","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9331","text":"Runs focused reasoning over selected SCC regions and returns reconciled conclusions with confidence metadata."}]},{"id":"blk-9681","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9332","marks":["code"],"text":"decompose"}]},{"id":"blk-9682","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9333","text":"Splits cyclic regions into scoped partitions (typically by fault lines) for manageable passes."}]},{"id":"blk-9683","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9334","marks":["code"],"text":"reconcile"}]},{"id":"blk-9684","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9335","text":"Combines partition-level intermediates into a coherent result suitable for downstream action or memory write-back."}]},{"id":"blk-9685","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9336","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9686","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9337","text":"6. Composition patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-9687","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9338","text":"Pattern A — Topology-aware reactive reasoning"}]},{"id":"blk-9688","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"query\n  -> &memory.graph.recall()\n  -> &memory.graph.topology()\n  -> &reason.deliberate.deliberate()\n  -> &memory.graph.learn()"},{"id":"blk-9689","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9339","text":"Use when a query touches cyclic regions and requires deeper reasoning before action."}]},{"id":"blk-9690","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9340","text":"Pattern B — Attention-triggered deliberation"}]},{"id":"blk-9691","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"heartbeat_or_demand\n  -> &reason.attend.survey()\n  -> &reason.attend.triage()\n  -> &reason.deliberate.deliberate()\n  -> output"},{"id":"blk-9692","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9341","text":"Use when an attention engine routes high-friction regions into explicit deliberation."}]},{"id":"blk-9693","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9342","text":"Pattern C — Deliberate then justify"}]},{"id":"blk-9694","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"topology_result\n  -> &reason.deliberate.deliberate()\n  -> &reason.argument.justify()\n  -> output"},{"id":"blk-9695","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9343","text":"Use when downstream stakeholders require structured justification artifacts."}]},{"id":"blk-9696","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9344","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9697","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9345","text":"7. Tier-aware behavior"}]},{"id":"blk-9698","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9346","text":"Implementations may adapt "},{"id":"spn-9347","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9348","text":" by declared "},{"id":"spn-9349","marks":["code"],"text":"model_tier"},{"id":"spn-9350","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-9699","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9701","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9351","marks":["code"],"text":"local_small"}]}],"id":"blk-9700","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9702","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9352","text":"Often uses single-pass strategy for higher κ only; may skip low-κ cycles below a floor."}]},{"id":"blk-9703","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9705","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9353","marks":["code"],"text":"local_large"}]}],"id":"blk-9704","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9706","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9354","text":"Typically supports multi-pass decomposition/reconciliation on κ > 0."}]},{"id":"blk-9707","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9709","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9355","marks":["code"],"text":"cloud_frontier"}]}],"id":"blk-9708","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9710","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9356","text":"Supports deeper multi-pass budgets and larger partition scopes."}]},{"id":"blk-9711","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9357","text":"This keeps routing semantics stable while adapting execution depth to available inference capacity."}]},{"id":"blk-9712","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9358","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9713","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9359","text":"8. Governance implications"}]},{"id":"blk-9714","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9360","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9361","text":" should honor governance boundaries in both routing and output handling:"}]},{"id":"blk-9715","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9717","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9362","text":"respect escalation thresholds ("},{"id":"spn-9363","marks":["code"],"text":"confidence_below"},{"id":"spn-9364","text":", cost limits, boundary flags)"}]}],"id":"blk-9716","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9719","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9365","text":"enforce hard constraints before downstream action dispatch"}]}],"id":"blk-9718","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9721","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9366","text":"avoid auto-execution when autonomy level is limited to "},{"id":"spn-9367","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-9368","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-9369","marks":["code"],"text":"advise"}]}],"id":"blk-9720","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9722","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9370","text":"A deliberation result should be treated as "},{"id":"spn-9371","marks":["bold"],"text":"decision support"},{"id":"spn-9372","text":", not unconditional permission to act."}]},{"id":"blk-9723","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9373","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9724","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9374","text":"9. Provenance implications"}]},{"id":"blk-9725","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9375","text":"A deliberation step should preserve strong traceability, including:"}]},{"id":"blk-9726","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9728","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9376","text":"topology basis (SCC IDs, κ values, fault-line edges)"}]}],"id":"blk-9727","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9730","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9377","text":"operation name and provider"}]}],"id":"blk-9729","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9732","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9378","text":"input and output hashes"}]}],"id":"blk-9731","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9734","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9379","text":"parent trace linkage"}]}],"id":"blk-9733","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9736","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9380","text":"timestamps and any transport trace IDs"}]}],"id":"blk-9735","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9737","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9381","text":"This is essential for replay, audit, and post-outcome learning loops."}]},{"id":"blk-9738","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9382","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9739","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9383","text":"10. Compatible providers"}]},{"id":"blk-9740","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9384","text":"Current ecosystem-aligned provider:"}]},{"id":"blk-9741","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9743","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9385","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous"}]}],"id":"blk-9742","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9744","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9386","text":"Protocol note: providers are implementations; "},{"id":"spn-9387","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9388","text":" remains the capability interface."}]},{"id":"blk-9745","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9389","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9746","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9390","text":"11. Anti-patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-9747","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9749","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9391","text":"Treating cyclic reasoning as plain one-shot ranking without topology context."}]}],"id":"blk-9748","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9751","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9392","text":"Collapsing "},{"id":"spn-9393","marks":["code"],"text":"decompose"},{"id":"spn-9394","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-9395","marks":["code"],"text":"reconcile"},{"id":"spn-9396","text":" semantics into undocumented prompt hacks."}]}],"id":"blk-9750","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9753","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9397","text":"Emitting deliberation outputs with no confidence or provenance linkage."}]}],"id":"blk-9752","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9755","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9398","text":"Skipping governance checks and directly dispatching real-world actions."}]}],"id":"blk-9754","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9756","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9399","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-9757","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-9400","text":"12. Summary"}]},{"id":"blk-9758","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9401","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.deliberate"},{"id":"spn-9402","text":" formalizes a critical reasoning mode for cyclic, feedback-heavy domains."}]},{"id":"blk-9759","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9403","text":"It gives agent systems:"}]},{"id":"blk-9760","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9762","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9404","text":"explicit topology-aware routing"}]}],"id":"blk-9761","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9764","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9405","text":"scoped decomposition for hard reasoning regions"}]}],"id":"blk-9763","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9766","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9406","text":"reconciled, confidence-bearing conclusions"}]}],"id":"blk-9765","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-9768","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9407","text":"clean composition with memory, governance, and provenance layers"}]}],"id":"blk-9767","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-9769","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-9408","text":"This makes deliberation a portable protocol capability rather than ad hoc prompt behavior."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraxhdkhfk73sg55b4whhxzsgue5qtmkqkfkcne2waquwhvi7shonxa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}